# The turn through the front and the stick's bomb stance (Paul's playtest, 2026-11-12;
# unit tests: testTurnShowsLeanFramesInOrder, testFrontHoverSways, testVolleysNeverBomb).
# X from the left side: three-quarter view (5 frames), a lean to the right (6), the front.
# Then on to the right: a lean, the three-quarter view, the side. Then back through
# the front, leaning left. A volley with the stick down never turns to the bombs.
wait-serial "AGK t0"
press fire 2
wait 125
press up 60
wait 20
screenshot side
press fire2 1
wait 2
screenshot turn34
wait 5
screenshot leanR
expect-color leanR 220 111 0x778   # the rotor's right end is low: a lean right
wait 20
screenshot front
wait 30
screenshot sway
press fire2 1
wait 8
screenshot leanR2
wait 20
press fire2 1
wait 8
screenshot leanL
expect-color leanL 120 111 0x778   # the rotor's left end is low: a lean left
wait 20
expect-serial "face=1"
# a volley while diving: the stick down and fire tapped, never the bombs
press fire2 1
wait 30
press down+fire 1
wait 5
press down+fire 1
wait 5
press down+fire 1
wait 30
expect-serial "sfx cannon"
expect-no-serial "sfx bomb"
